div.p:
Whereas the Dominican Republic has requested the
                    cooperation of the United States of America to put into execution a new protocol
                    which shall take into account these circumstances and the new provisions agreed
                    upon with the bondholders with regard to manner of payment of the public debt;
                    and the United States is disposed to give such cooperation;

The Dominican Republic undertakes to apply in the order indicated below the
                    proceeds of the customs duties collected in the various customs houses of the
                    Republic;
